          "correct": "A",
          "expl": "$S=\\dfrac{1}{2}ac\\sin B=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cdot4\\cdot2\\cdot\\sin135^\\circ=4\\cdot\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=2\\sqrt{2}$."
